  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a pan over medium heat.",
    "Add cumin seeds and let them sizzle for a few seconds.",
    "Add onion, ginger, and green chili, and sauté till the onion is translucent.",
    "Add carrot, coriander powder, turmeric powder, and salt. Mix well.",
    "Add the lentils, water, and tomato, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and cook covered for 30 minutes, or till the lentils are cooked.",
    "Add Marmite and Ferment-Jang. Mix well and let it simmer for a few minutes.",
